    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576630/extras/5d2dad527f083670c9048b1bda2a94db.avif?t=1753135711\" width=602 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Build a city on top of a UFO crash site. Your superhero girlfriend Heather will keep it safe and get herself into sexy trouble! Place new locations for Heather to visit and see what sorts of lewd events take place when she heads there on patrol!</i><br> <br><i>Prove your tactical skills and help Heather fight villains. Set up chain reaction contraptions in combat and hit multiple foes at once. Watch out, Heather will lose her clothes if she's defeated!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576630/extras/3a0e27bd2bfa7782a4dd6115a539bac8.avif?t=1753135711\" width=602 height=175 /></span><br><i>Build your city and watch your girlfriend as she saves it from crime or falls to temptation! With gameplay that combines city-building and Rube Goldberg machine combat, this is one unique adventure!</i><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576630/extras/7466b5676d46b1a5bda3aaf871356da0.avif?t=1753135711\" width=602 height=175 /></span>- </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Build your own city (Plan routes for combat, recovery and in game events)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Unique Combat System (Place objects and plan your attacks before executing)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Expand (Buildings may transform in accordance to how you place them)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hidden Challenges (Some events will give you requirements for different endings and events)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Unlock sex animation in Heather's encounters as she patrols the streets</i><br> <br> </p></li></ul>",
